#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:5
#: c6e0d60464364acba57e48618d02db0e
msgid "Copter Use-Case Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:7
#: faa32a74b82f4e3b900e272416db3823
msgid "This article provides an overview of some of the main use cases for Copter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:11
#: 6e731a2874e344898cbc3911d1b098d3
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:13
#: 5caadd795d0b4f0280f51e9107f34305
msgid "The Copter autopilot provides a stable flying platform that enables precise manual and automated control over vehicle position, speed, orientation and actions. The supported control behaviours are made available using autopilot :ref:`flight/control modes <flight-modes>`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:18
#: 5ac939bf2a094046a46b64ec5b394836
msgid "Manual flight modes like :ref:`Stabilize <stabilize-mode>`, :ref:`Alt Hold <altholdmode>` and :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` provide different types of stabilisation and make vehicles easier to fly and position. Other manual modes like :ref:`Follow Me <ac2_followme>` and :ref:`RTL (Return-to-Launch) <rtl-mode>` automate tasks that would otherwise require complex manual adjustments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:26
#: 0f49bee9e9e74ad5a7b69656022423bf
msgid ":ref:`AUTO Mode <auto-mode>` allows you to run complex missions that you can define using a :ref:`ground control station <common-choosing-a-ground-station>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:28
#: 62ef0545e80d4a76b4482b5827e3ca1e
msgid "A companion computer on the vehicle can communicate with/control Copter (for example, using `DroneKit-Python <https://github.com/dronekit/dronekit-python/>`__) and perform computationally intensive low-latency tasks like computer-vision."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:33
#: 11f53f18978d4cd49af6204d441ac51c
msgid "This stability and precision, and the flexibility in terms of manual and automated control, make Copter the ideal platform for many UAV applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:37
#: 405380cbe5de436c98cafa1c61b451f7
msgid "This article provides an overview of some of the main use cases, with special emphasis on those requiring photographic/video inspection or payload delivery in difficult-to-reach places."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:43
#: ca9f352329a44fa4b3e0df4928b82843
msgid "Additional use cases and information are covered in the section :ref:`Use Cases and Applications <common-use-cases-and-applications>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:47
#: eac8136d73b4460593181397037a4ba3
msgid "Still and Video Photography"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:49
#: 55765fa0fe194d81bc2095a6788c2a9e
msgid "Copter allows you to easily get to locations and take pictures/video that would otherwise be difficult (or impossible) to reach. For this reason, photography applications are currently the most highly developed use-case."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:54
#: df2eb4ed6c0144c7aac41010b6824c01
msgid "Copter provides a stable platform for photography, with additional stability and independent control of camera position (relative to the vehicle) provided by brushless camera gimbals. Copter supports camera-friendly flight modes like :ref:`Follow Me <ac2_followme>` and allows you to control/maintain the camera target at a specific region of interest."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:60
#: 34f521b38d6f4061967e156adb067931
msgid "Advanced systems like `3DR Solo implement even more advanced vehicle/camera control (\"smart shots\") using `DroneKit-Python <https://dronekit.io/>`__ running on a Companion Computer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:65
#: 95ed68a433354a01be89aec7483ed542
msgid "First Person View (FPV)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:67
#: f0dbbda179cb4598806958aef67d322f
msgid "*First Person View* allows you to fly your copter from the perspective of an actual on board pilot. This use case is discussed in the topic :ref:`First Person View (FPV) <common-fpv-first-person-view>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:72
#: 10ec54510e1a4196bf05c2ed07bad7ca
msgid "Disaster response"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:74
#: 6e6966e81c304f01b93727825cddba60
msgid "Copters can help save lives/provide relief in the event of major disasters (fires, flood, tornadoes, earthquakes, volcanic eruptions etc)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:78
#: 851a66c45fb241389af2b37191b3d81e
msgid "They are particularly useful for search and survey tasks, and for delivery of low-weight critical supplies, information and assistance. They can do this relatively cheaply without putting additional lives at risk (freeing up other resources to do actual recovery)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:84
#: b298d548c3354d9e9e580c8c5a743475
msgid "Search (and rescue)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:86
#: 1f3d6d37d68a40a88e6aaeeb06fe9d80
msgid "Copter makes an excellent platform for locating missing individuals and groups. Vehicles can perform a grid search and take photographs for either on-board (using a companion computer) or later analysis. Copter can search in hard-to-reach areas, and may be used in large numbers due to their low cost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:94
#: 5fe76f3e7a9d442aacc3a76e1110434c
msgid "Fixed wing vehicles have much greater range than Copter, and may be more suitable for searching large areas with low ground-cover."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:98
#: fd4e44d578514657ba3dbb1b53aae5c4
msgid "Agricultural applications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:100
#: 9e56b673da80489194027e75dfa77c15
msgid "Agricultural inspection is a growing field for UAV applications. Examples include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:103
#: 60677b9e7dc242e98895f2ef53874499
msgid "Tile and drainage inspections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:104
#: 1393b91a1a0f4280a2972307a460a4ff
msgid "Barn roof and silo inspections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:105
#: 3fbd3a2d76f5499db0e6db5817f97e15
msgid "Irrigation pivot inspections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:106
#: 85d3f06cede3419d8e52bf27944f46d2
msgid "Hail and cattle damage inspection for crop insurance claims"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:107
#: 13b1ca5a824d463fbf8b406c7dbdc955
msgid "Scare off pest-wildlife that eat crops"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:108
#: 01f475cde59149cb8dd7cc6253a4c123
msgid "Patrol for hunters on your private land"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:109
#: 11dde77c6b034d2e9b8ddd8ea5dcac19
msgid "Locate missing cattle (This is where a thermal camera comes in handy.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:111
#: 91ff3bfbdee04b7b91bd055b6079d749
msgid "Video check-ins for landlords"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:115
#: 6830b4cf4d12492282270508ba0bffe4
msgid "This promises to be one of the most important and earliest adopted civilian uses of Multicopters. One benefit is that there are fewer restrictions when flying over private land."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:120
#: 57e7ef845a8940099e51a53f48bc4fe8
msgid "Forest fire mitigation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:122
#: acc3423acaf0474ab5ccbef55208fd77
msgid "Copter has great potential for fire monitoring and detection (with an infrared camera, a Plane or Copter UAV can detect small camp fires even in heavy tree cover)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:127
#: 032fc6b5c15c4248b8d4fd208ca26079
msgid "Hazard/danger mitigation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:129
#: d1c5445661b748638db74a4a2d18a4cd
msgid "More generally, Copter and Plane are useful for other hazard mitigation as a cost-effective alternative to patrolling using airplanes, helicopters, or ground-based services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:133
#: a9c13f7638b14c4eacd46201a21bf8df
msgid "They are already being used for shark patrols in beach areas, and there is no reason they could not similarly be used in any other \"patrol\" activity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:138
#: f4b73ee8aaa148f894420dc0ca2aa625
msgid "3D Mapping and GIS (Geographic Information Systems)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:140
#: 8c139c30298546f28e6fa8d51ad29723
msgid "Copter makes an effective 3D Mapping platform with a wide variety of potential applications. For more information see the topic :ref:`3D Mapping <common-3d-mapping>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:144
#: fbb329a6c5a648b38bff6b47c1b334e3
msgid "Inspection, Verification and Sample Collection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:146
#: d8e23f5b41754a5582987aa583c6dfdc
msgid "Architectural and building inspection/verification are possibly the fastest growing UAV use case - due to the obvious benefits to being able to check construction quality and condition without having to create expensive scaffolding and other safety infrastructure. Copter is similarly useful for contour analysis, drainage and verifying adherence to plans."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:153
#: e8b74079fba84421b0f220a48bd5cce1
msgid "Copter is also useful for sample collection in difficult to reach or hazardous areas (this requires that the vehicle is fitted with a small probe or other sample device). The `Modcopter Sample Collection System <https://permalink.lanl.gov/object/tr?what=info:lanl-repo/lareport/LA-UR-13-23300>`__ is an excellent government-backed student project for accessing a variety of samples."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:160
#: 3453240325ab4082b68d4d5bc284da2f
msgid "Payload Based Applications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:162
#: 771b00a5ea6e43d8b47c96627aa6a46d
msgid "Copter is suitable for delivery of low-mass emergency supplies, including flotation devices, communications devices, shark repellent etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:166
#: 3a3c47a519f446e8bce5be0e62139717
msgid "There are active investigations into other commercial applications including crop spraying and package delivery."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:170
#: 7bd7e0b86c74474cb597c943f4cfd6d6
msgid "Other applications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:172
#: 664c2f0e76d64602bc3633627d9e29ec
msgid "Copters are being used or considered in many other applications:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:174
#: feb7526d38ee4edfbbfc50e9e548f9ff
msgid "Initial \"pilot line\" stringing for power lines from hilltop to hill top."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:176
#: 5d20472f0f984628beaa1e93f8be3a2e
msgid "Painting, touch up and maintenance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:177
#: ac77c5621a404252912332a07b0529fa
msgid "Tree trimming and spraying."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/copter-use-case-overview.rst:178
#: 651e478a71c54b49a12cbeafadb9bc76
msgid "Building and home cleaning."
msgstr ""

